+#   modality axis : audio tokens (codes, SOA, YUE2CODEC, EOA) and the whole-song header never write them;
+#                   decay is held at 1, so they keep what the lyric text wrote while the audio stream runs
+#   slot axis     : line text (SOS ... up to SOA) writes only the slot of its line, slot = (#SOS so far) mod M;
+#                   the other slots are held, so line j does not overwrite line j-1's memory
+# Reads (r) are untouched: every token reads every head. RWKV_SLOT_M=1 = modality axis only. 0 heads = stock RWKV-7.
